{
  "about": "Changing the list of patterns (spec/shift-patterns.md). deleted: deleting pattern `id` takes it from `patterns` and changes nothing that names it: other patterns keep it as their `nextDay`, and days and orders keep it, each read as naming a pattern that is gone (spec/sync-protocol.md, Deleted values). newJob: changing jobs; the new job's `incoming` patterns take over from the person's `own`, and an old one still on a day before the switch (`usedBefore`) stays after them. A ready-made pattern sharing an id with one of the person's that differs (name, mark, time, off, next day) and is still used before the switch keeps the person's id; the new job's takes a fresh one, which `sequence` (the new order) and next days use. Fresh ids are \"new-1\", \"new-2\"… in the order of `incoming`. `expected` lists the patterns by id, in order, with their next day. guessLook: a new pattern's mark from its name (design/src/patterns.ts, lookHints): the first hint with a word anywhere in the name gives its emoji and icon, else ⭐️ and the letter icon; the letter is the name's first character, trimmed. A mark picked by hand is never guessed again. nextColor: a new pattern's color, the first palette slot no pattern uses, else the count of patterns modulo the palette's 12 slots.",
  "deleted": [
    {
